{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-4",
  "title": "Types of Milestones",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Types of Milestones"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Below is a **high-level, end-to-end milestone sequence** you might see in a **full-service product design and development** engagement. Each project is unique, but these core milestones commonly appear in a comprehensive process:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Discovery & Requirements Gathering**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**User Research**: Identify target audience, pain points, and market gaps."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Stakeholder Interviews**: Align on goals, success metrics, and high-level features."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Project Scope**: Document functional and non-functional requirements; formalize the SOW."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Branding & Design Foundations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Brand Identity**: Finalize logo, color palette, typography, and overall creative direction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Design System**: Establish reusable UI components, spacing, icon sets, and style guidelines for consistency across the product."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **UX Wireframes & Prototyping**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Information Architecture**: Map out navigation flows, user journeys, and screen hierarchies."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Low-Fidelity Wireframes**: Sketch core layouts and content structure to validate flow and functionality."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Interactive Prototype**: A clickable prototype (in Figma, Sketch, etc.) for early feedback from stakeholders and users."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **High-Fidelity UI & Visual Designs**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Final Mockups**: Convert wireframes into polished screens with brand-aligned visuals, refined typography, and interactive states."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**User Testing**: Conduct usability tests on refined UI to confirm that flows are intuitive and engaging."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Technical Architecture & Planning**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Tech Stack Selection**: Decide on frontend frameworks, backend languages, databases, and devops approach."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Architecture Diagrams**: Outline system structure, APIs, microservices (if applicable), and data flows."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Sprint Planning**: Break down the work into sprints or development cycles, finalize backlog and priorities."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Frontend & Backend Development**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Backend Setup**: Implement server logic, databases, and API endpoints."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Frontend Development**: Build UI screens, integrate real data, and ensure responsiveness."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Integration**: Connect frontend with backend services, handle authentication, and set up any third-party integrations (payment gateways, AI APIs, etc.)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. **QA, Testing & Iteration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Functional Testing**: Verify each feature works as intended."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Performance & Security Checks**: Load tests, code reviews, and security scans to maintain stability."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Bug Fixing & Polishing**: Address issues, refine edge cases, and optimize user flows."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8. **Beta Release & User Feedback**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Staging/Beta Deployment**: Release a near-final version to select users or internal testers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Feedback Cycle**: Collect user insights, usage analytics, and bug reports."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Final Adjustments**: Prioritize and implement necessary fixes or feature tweaks before public launch."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "9. **Launch & Handoff**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Production Deployment**: Go live on app stores or web hosting (AWS, Azure, etc.)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Knowledge Transfer**: Provide documentation, design assets, brand guidelines, or style guides."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Team Training**: If needed, train internal teams on how to manage content, monitor systems, or handle ongoing updates."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "10. **Ongoing Maintenance & Iterative Growth**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Post-Launch Monitoring**: Track metrics (uptime, usage patterns, user satisfaction)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Continuous Improvement**: Add features, address new user stories, or adapt to changing requirements."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Long-Term Roadmap**: Plan major updates, expansions, or platform migrations as the product evolves."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Final Note"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Not every project will need each milestone in the same depth, and some phases often run in parallel (e.g., design iteration overlapping with backend architecture). But this list provides a **typical scaffold** that ensures a thorough, end-to-end product build—from initial idea to a robust, maintainable solution."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}